<title>SINGAPORE: Ossia International IPO subscribed 15.4 times.</title>
<headline>Ossia International IPO subscribed 15.4 times.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sporting goods and apparel manufacturing and distribution group Ossia International Ltd said on Monday that the public tranche of its initial public offer (IPO) was subscribed 15.4 times.</p>
<p>The figure was based on the 45 million shares available to the public for subscription, excluding 5 million reserved shares which were fully taken up.</p>
<p>Ossia's offer price was Singapore $0.61 per share.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
